# SableOS Zinwa Q25: battery guards (docs/implementation/power.md, Q4-POWER-IDLE).
#
# The vendor mtklog.rc turns on every pr_debug in "*mediatek*" files on
# userdebug and eng builds (`file *mediatek* +p` at sys.boot_completed=1),
# which is MediaTek's engineering logging. SableOS builds are userdebug for
# adb root, not for vendor debug logs, so turn it back off. Installed to
# /product/etc/init: init parses /product after /vendor, and actions for the
# same property change run in parse order, so this runs after mtklog.rc.
# With GKI's CONFIG_DYNAMIC_DEBUG_CORE only modules built with
# DYNAMIC_DEBUG_MODULE have entries, so this may match nothing; check with
# `adb shell grep -c '=p' /proc/dynamic_debug/control`.

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    write /proc/dynamic_debug/control "file *mediatek* -p"
